Package: valresultat
Title: Read and Harmonise Swedish Election Results
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Richard", "Öhrvall", email = "richard.ohrvall@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads, archives and parses Swedish election data published by
    Valmyndigheten. Provides harmonised, analysis-friendly tables of election
    results, candidacies, candidates, mandates, personal votes and substitute
    relationships. Supports local raw-data archives and remote sources.
    Active development currently focuses on the 2026 parliamentary, regional
    and municipal elections.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.2.0),
    janitor,
    jsonlite,
    xml2,
    purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    readr,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    roxygen2,
    testthat (>= 3.2.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/richardohrvall/valresultat
BugReports: https://github.com/richardohrvall/valresultat/issues
